algebra_linear — pure-Rust BLAS, LAPACK, and sparse LU

Copyright (c) 2026 Dorival Pedroso (the Rust transcription)

This crate is released under the BSD 3-Clause licence. Its dense kernels are a
transcription of LAPACK 3.12.1 and its reference BLAS, whose copyright notice and
licence conditions are the text below: it is reproduced verbatim, and it covers
the derived code in this crate. The sparse LU and its COLAMD ordering are a
translation of faer (MIT), whose notice — together with the SuiteSparse COLAMD
(BSD 3-Clause) notice — follows the LAPACK one. The crate stays BSD-3-Clause;
every derived notice is reproduced below.

LAPACK: https://www.netlib.org/lapack/ — version 3.12.1.

