================================================================================
faer — sparse LU and COLAMD (MIT)
================================================================================

The sparse LU in `src/sparse/` is a translation of faer's sparse LU and of
faer's COLAMD ordering, taken from faer commit ddbd2ae
(https://codeberg.org/sarah-quinones/faer). faer's sparse LU is distributed under
the MIT licence:

MIT License

Copyright (c) 2026 sarah quiñones el kazdadi

